# events_demo

cast WREN
  .label "Wren"

-- bell_tower

> The rope is rough in her hands.

~ fire bell_rang

WREN
  One.

~ fire bell_rang

WREN
  Two.

~ fire second_strike

-- response

after since(bell_rang) < 10000
  WREN
    That second strike was just now.

after since(second_strike) < 1000
  WREN
    The echo's still going.

WREN
  Total events recorded: ${count(event)}.

-> ending

-- ending

> Silence.
